 ## How it works
 ### Inputs and Outputs
-*   **Input:** A 2D transfer function domain defined by scalar data value ($v$) and gradient magnitude ($g$).
-*   **Output:** A transfer function mapping $(v, g)$ to color ($C$) and opacity ($\alpha$).
